 "words": 180,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From the tribe of Zebulun stood a man",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gaddiel son of Sodi was his name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses sent him from the Wilderness of Paran",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To scout the land as the Lord did command",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He walked through the Negev up to Hebron",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saw the giants there, the strong and the seven",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They cut a cluster in the Valley of Eshcol",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And carried it on a pole for the whole",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days they wandered out",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And came back to show the fruit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land flows with milk and honey",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the people are too strong to suit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They reported to the congregation",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Kadesh by the wilderness land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caleb spoke to quiet the fear",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But others said we cannot stand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days they wandered out",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And came back to show the fruit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land flows with milk and honey",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the people are too strong to suit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We seemed like grasshoppers in their eyes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Devoured by the land we spied",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The congregation wept through the night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grumbling loud against their guide",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Back to Egypt they wished to go",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leaving the promise to break",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
